node_modules/
lib/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env

# dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# A JavaScript GitHub Action runs from its bundle: GitHub does not install
# dependencies or run a build before invoking the Action, so dist/index.js is
# what actually executes. It is a build artifact that has to be committed.
#
# Run `npm run build` and commit the result with every change under src/.
